s7:s2:simprd |- ( ( ( F : NN --> CC /\ G : NN --> CC /\ H : NN --> CC ) /\ ( seq 1 ( + , F ) ~~> A /\ seq 1 ( + , G ) ~~> B ) /\ A. a e. NN ( H ` a ) = ( ( F ` a ) + ( G ` a ) ) ) -> seq 1 ( + , G ) ~~> B )
